      "type": "text",
      "text": "Mood stabilizers and atypical antipsychotics, esp short-term risperidone, may help; risperidone use in boys can be limited by AEs incl gynecomastia; lower-quality evidence for aripiprazole, ziprasidone and quetiapine."
